Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||04-24-2001||04:20 PM||||A woman visited a doctor because of her husband.<P>"Could you help me please? My husband thinks he's a dog. He's running around on all fours and only eats dog-food..."<P>"That's not good", the doctor replies, "dog-food contains all kinds of additives that are not meant for human consumption. That stuff will kill him. I don't know what to do but you really should try to get him back to normal..."<P>Three weeks later the doctor is walking down the street when he sees the woman. Curious how things are now, he walks up to the woman to ask how her husband is.<P>"He died..." she says with an emotional voice.<P>"Just what I thought, must have been the dog-food".<P>"No, no," the woman replies, "that wasn't it. He was licking his balls in the middle of the street and got run over by a truck..."||||reg||1
Z||000006||FieroLisa||04-24-2001||05:00 PM||||How many college students does it take to replace a lightbulb?<P>Several- one to hold the light bulb and the others to drink until the room spins.||||reg||1
Z||000007||hugh||04-24-2001||06:39 PM||||A man takes his wife to the doctor for a thorough examination and is told he will have the results within a few days.After a week he calls the doctor's office and is told they got the records mixed up.His wife has either Alzeimhers or aids.the man got upset and asked how he could find which it was.The doctor told him to take her for a ride around the block and drop her off.The man asked then what?The doctor's reply"If she makes it homedon't **** her"||||reg||1
Z||000008||Steve Normington||04-24-2001||07:04 PM||||A woman's face is horribly disfigured in an accident. The only way that the doctors can fix her up is with skin transplanted from her husbands butt.  She is terribly embarrased and makes her husband promise not to tell anyone about the operation.<P>Years later, she is looking in the mirror and she is overcome with emotion at the sacrifice her husband made and the fact that he has not told a soul about it. She runs to him and starts thanking him profusely. He tells her that he was glad to do it. When she wants to why, he tells her, "Think of how I feel when I see your mother kiss you goodbye."<P>------------------<BR>85 SE 2M6||||reg||10
Z||000009||Dnyee'||04-24-2001||11:15 PM||||A woman accompanied her husband to the doctor's office. After his checkup, the doctor called the wife into his office alone. He said, “Your husband is suffering from a very severe disease, combined with horrible stress. If you don't do the following, your husband will surely die: <BR>1. Each morning, fix him a healthy breakfast. Be pleasant and make sure he is in a good mood. <BR>2. For Lunch make him a nutritious meal he can take to work. <BR>3. For dinner, prepare an especially nice meal for him. <BR>4. Don't burden him with chores. <BR>5. Don't discuss your problems with him. <BR>6. Try to relax your husband in the evening by wearing lingerie and giving him plenty of back rubs. <BR>7. Encourage him to watch some type of team sporting event on television. <BR>8. And, most importantly, make love with your husband several times a week, and satisfy his every whim. <BR>If you can do this for the next 10 months to a year, I think your husband will regain his health completely." <BR>On the way home, the husband asked his wife, "What did the doctor say?" You're going to die," she replied. <BR>||||reg||1
